  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">skirt steak shows up at the cookout like an old friend, lean and bold with flavor to spare. Marinate it in tangy orange juice, garlic, and a touch of honey so the heat can sear a caramelized crust over tender, smoky bites. Gather around while fresh cilantro and lime brighten the plate and a lively salsa adds color and zing. With minimal fuss and a sizzling hot pan, this recipe turns humble beef into the star of the table. Slice the skirt steak thin, serve immediately, and savor every juicy mouthful.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-skirt-steak\">Why You’ll Love This skirt steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-skirt-steak\">How to Make Skirt Steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-skirt-steak\">Pro Tips for Making Skirt Steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-skirt-steak\">How to Serve this skirt steak</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-skirt-steak\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This skirt steak</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Incredibly flavorful and juicy, perfect for any occasion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick cooking time makes it ideal for weeknight dinners.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for various cuisines, from tacos to stir-fries.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Budget-friendly cut that doesn’t skimp on taste.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for grilling, searing, or marinating to enhance flavor.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-6381\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"6381\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><